{%- comment -%}
  HooknLoop — Abandoned checkout
  ==============================
  Paste into: Settings > Notifications > Abandoned checkout > Edit code.

  ⚠ THIS EMAIL DOES NOT SEND UNTIL IT IS SWITCHED ON
  The template is only half of it. Enable and time the send at:
  Settings > Checkout > Abandoned checkouts.
  Pasting this code alone changes nothing — Shopify will simply never fire it.

  WHAT THIS EMAIL IS FOR
  One job: get them back to the checkout they already filled in. {{ url }} is a
  recovery link that restores their cart, their address and their shipping
  choice — they resume rather than restart. So the button is the loudest thing
  on the page and everything else exists to remind them what is in the cart.

  NO DISCOUNT IN HERE, DELIBERATELY
  A discount code in the first abandoned-cart email teaches trade buyers who
  order monthly to abandon every cart and wait for the code. That is a margin
  leak disguised as a conversion win. If a discount is ever added, put it in a
  second, later email — never the first.

  NO URGENCY THEATRE EITHER
  No countdown, no "only 2 left", no "your cart expires". These buyers are
  restocking a workshop, not impulse shopping, and manufactured scarcity from a
  trade supplier reads as untrustworthy.
{%- endcomment -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light only">
  <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light only">
  <title>Your cart is still here</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    body,table,td,a { -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%; -ms-text-size-adjust:100%; }
    table,td { mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; }
    img { -ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic; border:0; height:auto; line-height:100%; outline:none; text-decoration:none; }
    body { margin:0 !important; padding:0 !important; width:100% !important; background:#f4f7fb; }
    a { color:#b8460a; }
    @media only screen and (max-width:600px){
      .full { width:100% !important; }
      .px { padding-left:22px !important; padding-right:22px !important; }
      .stack { display:block !important; width:100% !important; }
      .stack-gap { height:22px !important; line-height:22px !important; font-size:22px !important; }
      .btn a { display:block !important; text-align:center !important; }
      .h1 { font-size:27px !important; line-height:1.18 !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#f4f7fb;">

  <div style="display:none; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; max-height:0; max-width:0; opacity:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all; color:#f4f7fb;">
    Your cart is saved — pick up where you left off, no need to re-enter anything.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f7fb;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:0 12px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="full"
               style="width:600px; max-width:600px; margin:26px 0; background:#ffffff; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden;">

          <!-- ══ MASTHEAD ══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          {%- comment -%}
            No order number on this one — there is no order yet. The right-hand
            slot carries the cart size instead, which is the only reference that
            exists at this point.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#ffffff; padding:26px 30px 22px;" class="px">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="left" valign="middle">
                    {%- if shop.email_logo_url %}
                      <img src="{{ shop.email_logo_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="{{ shop.email_logo_width | default: 180 }}" style="display:block; max-width:200px; border:0;">
                    {%- else %}
                      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4509/3489/files/logo_5.png?v=1767767497" alt="HooknLoop" width="180" height="32" style="display:block; width:180px; height:32px; border:0;">
                    {%- endif %}
                  </td>
                  <td align="right" valign="middle">
                    <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.16em; color:#5a6b8c; text-transform:uppercase;">Your cart</div>
                    <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color:#142548; padding-top:3px;">
                      {{ line_items.size }} item{% if line_items.size != 1 %}s{% endif %}
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e7ecf4; font-size:0; line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>

          <!-- ══ MESSAGE ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 30px 0;" class="px">
              {%- comment -%}
                Distinct from abandoned-cart.liquid on purpose. This person
                reached checkout and typed their details in, so "one step away"
                is literally true and "nothing to re-enter" is a real promise —
                the recovery link restores the address and shipping choice.

                The cart version cannot say either of those things, because a
                cart abandoner never gave you an address. Keeping the two
                headlines different is what stops the later email sounding like
                a repeat of the earlier one.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <h1 class="h1" style="margin:0; font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:31px; line-height:1.14; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.02em; color:#142548;">
                {%- if customer.first_name -%}{{ customer.first_name }}, you were{%- else -%}You were{%- endif -%}<br>one step away.
              </h1>
              <p style="margin:15px 0 0; font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.62; color:#5a6b8c;">
                Your cart and your details are still saved. Pick up exactly where you left off — nothing to re-enter.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ══ CTA ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          {%- comment -%}
            {{ url }} is Shopify's recovery link: it restores the cart, the
            address and the shipping selection. That is the whole value of this
            email, so it is the one orange thing on the page.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:22px 30px 0;" class="px">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="btn">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" bgcolor="#e87722" style="border-radius:10px;">
                    <a href="{{ url }}"
                       style="display:inline-block; padding:15px 30px; font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15.5px; font-weight:800; color:#142548; text-decoration:none; border-radius:10px;">
                      Complete your order &rarr;
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ══ WHAT'S WAITING ════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 30px 0;" class="px">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:2px solid #142548;">
                {%- for line in line_items %}
                  <tr>
                    <td valign="top" width="62" style="padding:15px 14px 15px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf4;">
                      {%- if line.image %}
                        <img src="{{ line | img_url: 'compact_cropped' }}" width="62" height="62" alt="" style="display:block; width:62px; height:62px; border-radius:8px; background:#f4f7fb;">
                      {%- else %}
                        <div style="width:62px; height:62px; border-radius:8px; background:#f4f7fb;">&nbsp;</div>
                      {%- endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:15px 12px 15px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf4;">
                      <div style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.4; color:#142548;">{{ line.title | default: line.product.title }}</div>
                      {%- if line.variant.title and line.variant.title != 'Default Title' %}
                        <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:#5a6b8c; padding-top:5px;">{{ line.variant.title }}</div>
                      {%- endif %}
                      <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#142548; padding-top:7px;">&times;&nbsp;{{ line.quantity }}</div>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" align="right" style="padding:15px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf4; white-space:nowrap;">
                      <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:700; color:#142548;">{{ line.line_price | money }}</span>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                {%- endfor %}
              </table>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                     style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:13.5px; color:#5a6b8c; padding-top:14px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:5px 0; font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:800; color:#142548;">Subtotal</td>
                  <td align="right" style="padding:5px 0; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; color:#142548;">{{ subtotal_price | money }}</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              {%- comment -%}
                Shipping is not shown. It is not calculated until the address
                step, and inventing a figure here would be the same mistake as
                the delivery estimate we removed.
              {%- endcomment -%}
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ══ REASSURANCE ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          {%- comment -%}
            Three facts, not three sales lines. The most common reason a trade
            buyer stalls at checkout is uncertainty about stock, delivery and
            whether the price is the price — so those get answered plainly. Free
            shipping over $300 is a real threshold from the store's own rates,
            not an invented incentive.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:28px 30px 34px;" class="px">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f4f7fb; border-radius:12px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:18px 20px; font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.85; color:#5a6b8c;">
                    <span style="color:#142548; font-weight:700;">Stocked in Australia</span> — dispatched from our own warehouse, not drop-shipped.<br>
                    <span style="color:#142548; font-weight:700;">Free shipping over $300</span> — on all standard domestic orders.<br>
                    <span style="color:#142548; font-weight:700;">Need a custom size?</span> — we cut to length. Call before you order.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- ══ FOOTER ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#142548; padding:32px 30px;" class="px">
              <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0975/4509/3489/files/hnl-email-logo-footer.png?v=1786003221" alt="HooknLoop" width="164" height="29" style="display:block; width:164px; height:29px; border:0;">
              <div style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.62; color:#8194b5; padding-top:14px; max-width:430px;">
                Australian hook &amp; loop specialists — tapes, strips, dots and fasteners, stocked and dispatched locally.
              </div>
              <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.13); margin-top:22px; padding-top:22px;">
                <div style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.16em; color:#f0842a; text-transform:uppercase; padding-bottom:12px;">Need a hand?</div>
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td class="stack" valign="middle" style="white-space:nowrap; padding-right:18px;">
                      <a href="tel:+61340616287" style="font-family:ui-monospace,'SF Mono',SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',monospace; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap;">+61&nbsp;3&nbsp;4061&nbsp;6287</a>
                    </td>
                    <td class="stack-gap" style="font-size:0; line-height:0; height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
                    <td class="stack" valign="middle" align="right" style="white-space:nowrap;">
                      <a href="mailto:info@hooknloop.com.au" style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#c9d3e6; text-decoration:none; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,211,230,0.38); white-space:nowrap;">info@hooknloop.com.au</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>
              {%- comment -%}
                unsubscribe_link is mandatory — Shopify rejects a marketing
                template without it, and the Australian Spam Act requires a
                working opt-out on commercial email regardless.

                Quiet, not hidden: a hard-to-find unsubscribe earns spam
                complaints, and a spam complaint costs more deliverability than
                the subscriber was worth.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <div style="border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.13); margin-top:22px; padding-top:16px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="left">
                      <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">hooknloop.com.au</a>
                    </td>
                    <td align="right">
                      <a href="{{ unsubscribe_link }}" style="font-family:'DM Sans','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#8194b5; text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  {%- comment -%} Required by Shopify: the open-tracking pixel. {%- endcomment -%}
  {{ open_tracking_block }}

</body>
</html>
